<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<section xml:id="coursematerialsM170" xmlns:xi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XInclude">
  <title>Course Materials and Links</title>

  <p>The text for this course is <url href="https://library.tbil.org/2026/calculus/frontmatter.html" 
  visual="library.tbil.org/2026/calculus/"><pubtitle>Calculus for Team-Based Inquiry</pubtitle></url>. 
  The text is free and online.</p>

  <p>We will also be using the associated  <url href="https://library.tbil.org/2026/calculus/exercises/#/bank/" 
  visual="library.tbil.org/2026/calculus/exercises/#/bank/">Check-It</url> problem bank for quizzes.</p>

  <p>We are using <url href="https://athena.cs.linfield.edu/webwork2/MATH170-Nordstrom" 
  visual="athena.cs.linfield.edu/webwork2/MATH170-Nordstrom">WeBWorK</url> for online homework sets. 
  You will need to login using the instructions provided in class.</p>

  <p>Dates and assignments for this course are posted on our 
  <url href="https://nordstrommath.com/courses/M170F26_hw.html" 
  visual="athena.cs.linfield.edu/webwork2/MATH170-Nordstrom">assignments</url> page.</p>

  <p>Links to the course resources are also posted in <url href="https://learn.linfield.edu/ultra/institution-page" 
  visual="learn.linfield.edu/ultra/">Blackboard</url>.</p>
  
</section>